# ============================================
# ACL (Access Control List) - Least-Privilege-Prinzip
# ============================================
# Jeder Benutzer bekommt nur die minimal nötigen Rechte

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# BRIDGE SERVICE (nur Leserechte fuer Sensordaten)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
user bridge_user
topic read sensor/#
topic read status/+/online
topic read lwt/+

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# PROVISIONER SERVICE
# ------------------------------------------------------------
user provisioner
topic read provisioning/request
topic write provisioning/response
topic read provisioning/status
topic write provisioning/status

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# TEST_DEVICE (vollständige Rechte fuer Tests)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
user test_device
topic read #
topic write #
topic read /#
topic read sensor/#
topic write sensor/temperatur
topic read status/+
topic write status/+
topic read lwt/+
topic write lwt/+
topic read test/#
topic write test/#
topic read commands/+
topic write commands/+

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# DYNAMISCHE GERÄTE (für mehrere ESP8266 - Least Privilege)
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Jedes Gerät darf nur auf seine eigenen Topics schreiben
pattern read sensor/#
pattern write sensor/temperatur
pattern read status/%u/online
pattern write status/%u/online
pattern read lwt/%u
pattern write lwt/%u
pattern read commands/%u/ota
